1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,820
All right guys here we go this is the valley where I want to build my shelter and camp for the night.
好了各位，这就是我想搭庇护处、过夜露营的山谷。

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:08,339
You can see there's there's no trees there's no firewood.
你们可以看到，这里没树，也没柴火。

3
00:00:08,339 --> 00:00:11,380
So if I want to go to shelter I'm going to have to use what's available.
所以如果想有遮蔽处，他就得用现成能找到的材料。

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:17,130
And there's plenty of rocks and you can see here somebody had the same idea that I have.
这里石头很多，看起来之前有人有过同样想法。

5
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:20,329
Started stacking up some rocks to make a shelter for their tent.
他们开始堆起石头，为帐篷做遮蔽处。

6
00:00:20,339 --> 00:00:26,009
So I'm gonna go ahead and use this to build my shelter.
所以作者准备利用这里搭自己的遮蔽处。

7
00:00:26,019 --> 00:00:35,050
All right I got a tarp here I'm gonna lay it out to kind of get the dimensions of my shelter.
他拿出篷布，铺开来，大致确定庇护处的尺寸。

8
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:39,860
The wind is consistently blowing from this direction which means I've got to build this wall up.
风持续从这个方向吹，所以他打算把这面墙堆高。

9
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:44,820
That's going to be my primary wind break my entrance to my shelter is going to come this way.
那将是他主要的挡风处，入口朝这个方向。

10
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:49,690
All right I think I got my dimensions figured out time to get to work.
我想尺寸已经弄清楚了，该开工了。

11
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:10,009
It is so nice in here there's no breezes.
里面真舒服，没有风。

12
00:01:10,019 --> 00:01:24,090
It's nice and warm I'm completely out of the wind and I've got enough room where I can sit up easily.
这里暖和，完全避开了风，还有足够空间轻松坐直。

13
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:26,650
Now I need to get some water going.
现在作者要弄些水。

14
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:36,730
Look at this water you know we got clean water coming out.
看这水，作者说流出来的是干净水。

15
00:01:36,740 --> 00:01:42,500
Gravity just pulls the untreated water through the filter right here fills up my water bottle.
他说，重力把未经处理的水拉过过滤器，流进水瓶。

16
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:44,820
Just go like that clamps it off.
这样一夹，就把水流关上。

17
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:52,250
Only took about 60 seconds to fill up my bottle that's good tasting water.
他说大约六十秒就装满水瓶，尝着不错。

18
00:01:52,260 --> 00:02:04,889
Well I think next on the agenda I need to catch a fish.
接下来的安排，我得去钓条鱼。

19
00:02:04,899 --> 00:02:17,370
But I'll tell you what it's cold my fingers are a little bit dumb.
但说真的，很冷，我的手指有点……原字幕为 dumb，疑似 numb，待听辨。

20
00:02:17,380 --> 00:02:21,620
Nice little rainbow a little small but I hooked him kind of bad.
钓到一条小虹鳟。鱼有点小，但他觉得鱼钩挂伤得比较重。

21
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:30,730
So I think I better keep him and eat him.
所以作者想，还是留下来吃吧。

22
00:02:30,740 --> 00:02:35,290
Nice another one let's get them back in the water here.
不错，又一条，把它们放回水里。

23
00:02:35,300 --> 00:03:01,370
I just broke my fishing rod tell you what I'm freezing it's cold out here I think it's time to go make some dinner.
鱼竿刚折了。真是冻坏了，外面很冷，该回去做晚餐了。

24
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:16,330
That butane squirted out so fast it gave give my finger a little bit of frostbite.
他说丁烷喷出得太快，导致手指出现一点冻伤。

25
00:03:17,459 --> 00:03:20,500
All right I made up a batch of couscous and craisins.
好了，他做了一份古斯米和蔓越莓干。

26
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:25,900
A little bit of rosemary and basil and salt in there but I'm gonna go ahead and cook up that fish.
里面加了些迷迭香、罗勒和盐，他接着要把那条鱼做熟。
